I would love to recommend this game, if it weren't because the ball is bugging heavily in the wall before bouncing back... It looks like someone took a Physics gun from Garrysmod and scraped the ball across the wall before finally letting go a few meters later...
Great visuals, but horrible ball physics... and the controls is nothing groundbreaking too. Get it cheap if you don't care and just want to wreck stuf... it does that very well.. haha.. but nonetheless, it was VERY satisfying to see all that stuff break apart exactly as you expected; Violently and brutal without mercy.
But those ball physics killed all that joy for me... ;_;

