Amazing game with awesome progression.
Incredibly fun with friends in story Co-Op (it's main strength).
Pros:
-Great Co-Op with up to 4 buddies, with already integrated spiltscreen;
-Fantastic progression (it actually feels like we're progressing);
-Pretty Nice Graphics;
-Great Optimization (i can't notice that much lack of because i've got a pretty beefy build, but a friend told me how he's running the game);
-Pretty optimized controls (Controller reccomended, otherwise you'll be in a pretty big disadvantage);~
-Awesome base building;
Cons:
-No actual scope aim, even though scopes can be put into weapons;
-Keyboard players have too much keys to use;
-Very little building variety for base buildings;
It's a very, very awesome game, although me and my friend don't play it as much now, i still plan to get more friends and play this more.
8.5/10
